[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13922.71, "timestamp": "03:52:02", "text": "每天你都会看到一些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13925.03, "timestamp": "03:52:05", "text": "Google 文档"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13927.429, "timestamp": "03:52:07", "text": "这个和那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13935.91, "timestamp": "03:52:15", "text": "是的。这也是其中一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13939.59, "timestamp": "03:52:19", "text": "我从来不希望那种文化存在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13943.75, "timestamp": "03:52:23", "text": "以印度 YouTube 长矛的形式出现。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.15, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "令人遗憾的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13948.469, "timestamp": "03:52:28", "text": "那从来都不是那么不切实际的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13952.07, "timestamp": "03:52:32", "text": "可惜的是，它从未奏效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13955.03, "timestamp": "03:52:35", "text": "但我很好奇是否存在无毒空间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13962.79, "timestamp": "03:52:42", "text": "天知道有多少聊天记录。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.91, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "但是，是的，我意识到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13978.229, "timestamp": "03:52:58", "text": "任何社区都会有"}]